{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-pu-learning","title":"为何需要正例无标签学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/foundations/why-pu-learning","wordCount":2111,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"pu-scenarios","title":"PU 场景与 SCAR 假设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/foundations/pu-scenarios","wordCount":1708,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"pu-taxonomy","title":"PU 方法谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/positive-unlabeled-learning/foundations/pu-taxonomy","wordCount":1677,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>要理解 PU 学习的所有方法，得先接受一个反直觉的事实：训练集里那些没被标注的样本，不是负例，而是正负两类的混合体。这一章就把这个事实立起来，并把它形式化到可以推导的程度。</p>\n<p>第一篇（<code>1_why-pu-learning.md</code>）回答「为什么需要 PU 学习」：它列举 PU 数据在现实中如何自然产生，演示「把未标注当负例」这个朴素基线会怎样系统性地失效，并划清 PU 与监督、半监督、一类学习的边界。读完你会知道 PU 不是数据脏了，而是一类独立的学习问题。</p>\n<p>第二篇（<code>2_pu-scenarios.md</code>）回答「数据是怎么生成的」：核心是 SCAR 假设——被标注的正例是从全体正例里完全随机抽出来的。它还区分两种采样场景（单训练集 / 案例-对照），并引入贯穿全 hub 的两个量：类先验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与标注频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。这一篇是后面风险估计、类先验、选择偏差三处推导的公共地基。</p>\n<p>第三篇（<code>3_pu-taxonomy.md</code>）给出整个领域的方法谱系：两步法、有偏重加权、风险估计、生成式四大家族各自的思路与适用条件，并把它们映射到本 hub 后续的具体篇目。它是一张导航图，先看它再进「方法」章会更有方向感。</p>\n<p>学完这一章，你应当能准确复述 SCAR 假设、说清楚朴素基线为何有偏，并在听到一个新方法时判断它属于谱系里的哪一支。</p>\n"}